     * @result
     *   "PASS   A bad code threw an exception of ReferenceError: b is not
     *       defined."
     *   "PASS   A bad construction threw DOMException:NotSupportedError."
     *   "PASS   Assigning d to c threw ReferenceError: d is not defined."
